{
  "slug": "local-seo-audit-system",
  "name": "Local Seo Audit System",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Complete 21-phase local business SEO audit system for Claude Code. Covers technical SEO, on-page, content strategy, local SEO & GBP, AI visibility (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, AI Overviews), competitor analysis, backlinks, reputation, and more.\n\nIncludes two proprietary scoring frameworks:\n• LOCAL-IMPACT — 60-item local presence assessment across 8 dimensions (0–100)\n• SERP-TRUST — 50-item search trust assessment across 5 dimensions (0–100)\n• SEO Health Index — weighted combination of both frameworks\n\nOutputs a professional PDF report with SVG score gauges, color-coded issue cards, competitor comparison charts, and 30/90/180/365-day action roadmaps. Zero external dependencies — works with WebSearch and WebFetch out of the box. Optional MCP integrations for Google Search Console, GA4, Google Business Profile, PageSpeed Insights, and SimilarWeb.\n\n27 skills, 40 slash commands, 6 specialized parallel sub-agents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **28 skills**, **6 agents**, **42 commands**, **3 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (28): `seo-audit-identity` (Core identity and expertise for SEO auditing), `local-impact-auditor` (Score a local business using the proprietary 60-item LOCAL-IMPACT framework across 8 dimensions (Listing, Reviews, Citations, Authority, Local…), `serp-trust-auditor` (Score a website using the proprietary 50-item SERP-TRUST framework across 5 dimensions (Technical Foundation, Ranking Signals, User Experience,…), `audit-intake` (Handles the initial data collection phase for SEO audits), `competitor-analysis` (Comprehensive competitor analysis for local SEO audits), `keyword-gaps` (Keyword research and gap analysis), `content-gaps` (Content gap analysis — identifies missing content opportunities vs), `topical-gaps` (Topical map and gap analysis), and 20 more\n- **Agents** (6): `ai-visibility-analyst` (AI visibility and GEO specialist for Phase 14 (AI SEO & GEO), Phase 16 (Brand SERP & Knowledge…), `content-analyst` (Content audit specialist for Phase 4 (Content Audit), Phase 5 (Content Gaps), Phase 7 (Topical Gaps), and Phase…), `keyword-analyst` (On-page and keyword specialist for Phase 3 (On-Page SEO), Phase 6 (Keyword Gaps), and Phase 9 (Entity Audit)), `local-seo-analyst` (Local SEO specialist for Phase 11 (Local SEO & GBP), Phase 15 (Reputation & Reviews), and Phase 21…), `offpage-analyst` (Off-page SEO specialist for Phase 12 (Backlinks & Link Profile), Phase 13 (Social Media), and Phase 17 (UX…), `technical-analyst` (Technical SEO specialist for Phase 2 (Technical SEO), Phase 10 (Speed/CWV), and Phase 19 (Accessibility))\n- **Commands** (42): `ai-visibility-check` (Quick AI visibility check across all major AI platforms), `audit-accessibility` (Run accessibility audit with SEO focus (Phase 19)), `audit-action-plan` (Generate a prioritized action plan from audit findings), `audit-ai-content` (Detect AI-generated content patterns and provide humanization recommendations (Phase 4a)), `audit-ai-seo` (Run AI visibility & AI SEO audit (Phase 14)), `audit-authority` (Assess topical authority (Phase 8)), `audit-backlinks` (Run backlink & link profile audit (Phase 12)), `audit-brand-serp` (Run brand SERP & Knowledge Panel audit (Phase 16)), and 34 more\n- **Hooks** (3): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install local-seo-audit-system@claude-community` from `mshahiddigital/local-seo-audit`.",
